<item><title>Lutchigadoo asks Mauritius court to cut 18-year drug sentence</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/lutchigadoo-asks-mauritius-court-to-cut-18-year-drug-a3a1c9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/lutchigadoo-asks-mauritius-court-to-cut-18-year-drug-a3a1c9/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>His defence seeks a term of 13 to 15 years, while prosecutors argue the appeal has not shown the sentence was legally wrong.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:29:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritius power board seeks 15 MW to offset Nicolay G2 outage</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-power-board-seeks-15-mw-to-offset-nicolay-g2-985186/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-power-board-seeks-15-mw-to-offset-nicolay-g2-985186/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The 20 MW gas turbine has been out of service since 19 November, and Indian technicians are repairing it.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:29:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritius adds Rs 150 fee per parcel on small online orders</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-adds-rs-150-fee-per-parcel-on-small-online-orders-ab8fff/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-adds-rs-150-fee-per-parcel-on-small-online-orders-ab8fff/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The fee applies to each declared personal parcel, so a Rs 900 basket split across three parcels adds Rs 600 before delivery.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:00:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Bank of Mauritius raises Key Rate to 5%, lifting study-loan costs</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-raises-key-rate-to-5-lifting-study-loan-ad1da3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-raises-key-rate-to-5-lifting-study-loan-ad1da3/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The 11 November increase came as the bank sought to counter 6,4% annual inflation, while overseas students also face rupee exchange rates.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:00:24 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-raises-key-rate-to-5-lifting-study-loan-ad1da3/share.jpg" length="42070" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-raises-key-rate-to-5-lifting-study-loan-ad1da3/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Port-Louis assigns about 350 Night Market stalls by lottery</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/port-louis-assigns-about-350-night-market-stalls-by-lottery-1de583/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/port-louis-assigns-about-350-night-market-stalls-by-lottery-1de583/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The market opens at Champ-de-Mars on 18 December, with traders paying Rs 150 per place each day, as hundreds seek a stall.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:50:44 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
